#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:2
msgid "Setting up outgoing webhooks"
msgstr "设置外出 Webhook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:4
msgid ""
"When a project build is *triggered*, *successful* or *failed*, Read the Docs"
" can notify external APIs using outgoing :term:`webhooks <webhook>`. These "
"webhooks contain information about the build and build status and can allow "
"an external service to use this information for alerting, monitoring, and "
"many other custom configurations."
msgstr ""
"项目构建*触发*、*成功*或*失败*时，Read the Docs 可使用外出 :term:`webhooks <webhook>` 通知外部 "
"API。这些 Webhook 包含构建和构建状态信息，允许外部服务将其用于告警、监控等各种自定义配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:12
msgid ":doc:`/guides/build/email-notifications`"
msgstr ":doc:`/guides/build/email-notifications`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:13
msgid "Setup basic email notifications for build failures."
msgstr "为构建失败设置基础邮件通知。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:15
msgid ":doc:`/pull-requests`"
msgstr ":doc:`/pull-requests`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:16
msgid ""
"Configure automated feedback and documentation site previews for your pull "
"requests."
msgstr "为你的 Pull Request 配置自动反馈和文档站点预览。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:20
msgid ""
":doc:`Builds for pull requests </pull-requests>` do not trigger outgoing "
":term:`webhooks <webhook>`."
msgstr ":doc:`Pull Request 构建 </pull-requests>` 不会触发外出 :term:`webhooks <webhook>`。"

