msgid "Verifying the payload"
msgstr "验证载荷"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/webhooks.rst:204
msgid ""
"After you add a new webhook, Read the Docs will generate a secret key for it"
" and use the key to generate a hash signature (HMAC-SHA256) for each "
"payload. This signature is included in the ``X-Hub-Signature`` header of "
"each request."
msgstr ""
"添加新 Webhook 后，Read the Docs 会为其生成一个密钥，并用该密钥为每个载荷生成哈希签名（HMAC-"
"SHA256）。此签名包含在每个请求的 ``X-Hub-Signature`` 头中。"

